Game Copyright Notice (GOD EATER Series)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is an independent, unofficial research and tooling effort
targeting GOD EATER RESURRECTION and GOD EATER 2 Rage Burst on PC.
It is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or approved by the
rights holders of those games.

GOD EATER (噬神者 / ゴッドイーター) and all related titles, characters,
artwork, music, story, and trademarks are the property of their
respective rights holders, including BANDAI NAMCO Entertainment Inc. and
SHIFT Inc. All rights reserved.

This project redistributes NO game assets. It provides only:
  - format documentation (reverse-engineering findings)
  - source code for reading/parsing those formats
  - analysis tooling

Any game data required for use must be obtained from the user's own
legally acquired copy of the game. The games themselves are not
redistributed here and remain governed by their own licenses.

Reverse engineering performed here is for interoperability research and
preservation purposes only.

