----------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope Notes
----------------------------------------------------------------------

  * This repository covers the PC versions of GOD EATER RESURRECTION and
    GOD EATER 2 Rage Burst only. PSP / PSV / PS4 formats are documented
    only for comparison, not supported by the tooling here.

  * The documentation describes the on-disk format as observed. It is
    research output, not an official specification.

  * No game executable is modified, redistributed, or replaced by this
    project.

